Code in this repository is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version. The licence text is in LICENSE.

The Rust crates listed in src-tauri/Cargo.lock are compiled into the launcher binary and keep
their own licences. cargo stores each crate's licence text under %USERPROFILE%\.cargo\registry\src\
after a build; a binary distribution must carry the licence texts of the crates it contains.
The npm packages listed in package-lock.json are development tools (the Tauri CLI and TypeScript)
and are not part of the launcher.

The installer is built with NSIS, which the Tauri CLI downloads; NSIS is under the zlib licence.
The launcher runs on the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime installed on the player's PC.

No Bethesda game files are included. Skyrim and related marks belong to their owners.
